  <running_head>MATERIARUM</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword>4. Non</catchword>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 11.</l>
    <l n="2">1. Inter absentes concepta Stipulatio non</l>
    <l n="3">valet.</l>
    <l n="4">2. Pro instrumento praesumendum.</l>
    <l n="5">3. Quo modo improbetur instrumentum?</l>
    <l n="6">4. Quotuplex sit negativa, &amp; qua probari</l>
    <l n="7">possit?</l>
    <l n="8" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 12.</l>
    <l n="9" para="true">Stipulationum exempla proponuntur quae</l>
    <l n="10">olim inutilia.</l>
    <l n="11" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 13.</l>
    <l n="12" para="true">Praeposterè concepta stipulatio valet.</l>
    <l n="13" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 14.</l>
    <l n="14" para="true">Quando moriens moriatur?</l>
    <l n="15" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 16.</l>
    <l n="16">1. Omissa in instrumento si spectent in-</l>
    <l n="17">trinsecam solemnitatem, subintelli-</l>
    <l n="18">guntur.</l>
    <l n="19">2. Non idem statuendum de testium assertione.</l>
    <l n="20" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 18.19.</l>
    <l n="21">1. Alteri stipulari nemo potest.</l>
    <l n="22">2. Iure Canonico secus obtinere censent.</l>
    <l n="23" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 22.</l>
    <l n="24">1. Error in re vitiat stipulationem.</l>
    <l n="25">2. Non si error sit in nomine.</l>
    <l n="26">3. Non si circa materiam sit error.</l>
    <l n="27">4. Quid iure Divino?</l>
    <l n="28" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 24.</l>
    <l n="29" para="true">Conditionalis stipulatio ad haeredes</l>
    <l n="30">transmittitur.</l>
    <l n="31" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 25.</l>
    <l n="32" para="true">Factum in stipulatum deductum, in se tempus continet.</l>
    <l n="33" type="heading" level="1" caput="21" para="true">LIBR. 3. INSTIT. TIT. 21.</l>
    <l n="34" type="heading" level="1" caput="21">De Fidejussoribus.</l>
    <l n="35" para="true">In Princ.</l>
    <l n="36" para="true">Quibus nominibus appelletur fidejussor?</l>
    <l n="37" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 1.</l>
    <l n="38">1. Cui obligationi fidejussor accedat?</l>
    <l n="39">2. Quando non accedat?</l>
    <l n="40">3. Fidejussor arctius obligari potest.</l>
    <l n="41">4. Quando tantum civile subest debitum,</l>
    <l n="42">non recte datu-</l>
    <l n="43">r fidejussor.</l>
    <l n="44" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 2.</l>
    <l n="45">1. Haeres fidejussoris etiam est obligatus.</l>
    <l n="46">2. Proponuntur aliquot exceptiones.</l>
    <l n="47" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 3.</l>
    <l n="48" para="true">Discrimen constituitur inter mandato Differentia constituitur</l>
    <l n="49">inter mandatarem &amp; fidejussorem.</l>
    <l n="50" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 4.</l>
    <l n="51" para="true">1. Fidejussor habet beneficium ordinis.</l>
    <l n="52" para="true">2. Quod cessat in multis casibus.</l>
    <l n="53" para="true">3. Qui beneficio ordinis renunciavit para-</l>
    <l n="54">ta executione adversus reum compe-</l>
    <l n="55">tente conveniri potest.</l>
    <l n="56" para="true">4. Iure Hebraeorum quid obtineat?</l>
    <l n="57" para="true">5. Quid moribus?</l>
    <l n="58" para="true">6. Quid jure Canonum?</l>
    <l n="59" para="true">7. Quid sit beneficium Divisionis?</l>
    <l n="60" para="true">8. Quibus casibus cessset?</l>
    <l n="61" para="true">9. Quid sit beneficium actionum cedenda-</l>
    <l n="62">rum?</l>
    <l n="63" para="true">10. Quibus modis cessat?</l>
    <l n="64" para="true">11. Quid moribus obtineat?</l>
    <l n="65" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 5.</l>
    <l n="66" para="true">1. Fidejussores in plus obligari non possunt?</l>
    <l n="67" para="true">2. Quot modis in plus quis obligetur?</l>
    <l n="68" para="true">3. In minus recte obligantur fidejussores.</l>
    <l n="69" para="true">4. Quid moribus?</l>
    <l n="70" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 6.</l>
    <l n="71" para="true">1. Fidejussor actione mandati contra debi-</l>
    <l n="72">torem experiri potest.</l>
    <l n="73" para="true">2. Non semper tamen.</l>
    <l n="74" para="true">3. Nec actioni mandati locus, nisi solveris</l>
    <l n="75">fidejussor, exceptis quibusdam casibus.</l>
  </main_text>
